IWBTG Collection
Copyright 2026 IWBTG Collection contributors

IWBTG Collection is one client that plays I Wanna Be The Guy fangames. Every
supported game is rebuilt in this repository's own documented format; the client
never runs original games or their engines. The project is non-commercial and will
never be monetized.

