Game content
------------

Game content is not covered by the code or documentation licences. Each ported game
and its assets belong to its creators, who can have the game removed from the
project, its builds and its download server. Game content in this repository is
marked LicenseRef-Game-Content in REUSE.toml; see LICENSES/LicenseRef-Game-Content.txt.

The showcase package (crates/client/showcase.pkg) holds five sprites from a fangame,
credited in its CREDITS.md: the Kid is the character and sprite of I Wanna Be The Guy
by Kayin, as shipped in the IWBTG fangame engine, taken from waka's I wanna Little
Trap conversion. They are here, few and credited, by the user's decision of
2026-11-11. Their owners can have them removed.

Per-file licence and copyright information is in REUSE.toml and can be checked with
`reuse lint`.
